<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-061-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.313668" lon="-120.887832"><name>SC26-061-C</name><cmt>SC26-061</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 45/100; not catch probability. Center 74 ft; nearby 67–85 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-044</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.314948889222975" lon="-120.88631367902806"/><trkpt lat="35.31476867284742" lon="-120.88631836999409"/><trkpt lat="35.31477443979997" lon="-120.88664817480249"/><trkpt lat="35.31450603726688" lon="-120.8867651446692"/><trkpt lat="35.31451180296386" lon="-120.88709494850657"/><trkpt lat="35.31433158648431" lon="-120.88709963766375"/><trkpt lat="35.31434119391851" lon="-120.88764930971647"/><trkpt lat="35.31470162699906" lon="-120.88763993379581"/><trkpt lat="35.314711232064276" lon="-120.88818960854395"/><trkpt lat="35.314440907160595" lon="-120.88819663867352"/><trkpt lat="35.314435144478324" lon="-120.88786683488934"/><trkpt lat="35.31407471132906" lon="-120.88787620971105"/><trkpt lat="35.313900257313236" lon="-120.88821069865187"/><